msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:coreAxisIndex, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "À lire avec logic:characteristicSort : le couple (logic:characterizes gmeow:coreAxisIndex, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) constitue l'obligation entière, et la vue de fondement OWL en projette la caractéristique correspondante."

